            <tspan fill="#A39A8E">Fri 4:52pm</tspan> · Dana edited Payroll → $24,103
          </text>
          <text class="rt-audit-row rt-audit-row--2 sans" x="18" y="348" font-size="10" fill="#1A1714">
            <tspan fill="#A39A8E">Sat 11:03am</tspan> · Priya viewed Payroll — no conflict
