  <!-- ── What to Do Divider ─────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="b4s2" aria-labelledby="what-now-heading">
    <h2 id="what-now-heading">What to Do If This Sounds Familiar</h2>
    <p>
      Recognizing one or two of these signs doesn't necessarily mean you need to overhaul
      everything overnight — but if most of them sound familiar, it's worth treating this
      as a planning priority rather than something to revisit "someday."
    </p>
    <div class="btn-wrap">
      <a href={site.appUrl} class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        TRY NOW
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

